{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12d2f4d0af3cf58750419368307413532861157402ffcf5e3713da03149944d8", "ja": "（PVの撮影が終わり、百合子が戻ってきたのだが……\n撮影中の笑顔はどこへ行ったのか、妙に静かだ）", "zh": "（PV拍摄结束后，百合子回来了，可是……\n拍摄时的笑容去哪儿了？她安静得有些反常。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5bb61195c11ff6ba5c82bd5875c6bf7021ff692cca46b04555052bffb1a0ce24", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。\nえっと……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。\n那个……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "c3f2c2a518147cebd2dbaba4dd58d17e3d8497e51b818fd38e4aa227effcf178", "ja": "{$P$}さん……もう少しだけ\n待ってください。私は今、旅をしています。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……请再等一会儿。\n我现在正在旅行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "e905ae953cf800333b283beaacf8b73b85fce5fe62f2bb738577f56b7e168f87", "ja": "純白の美しい翼をもつペガサスにまたがって……\n大空を、自由自在に飛び回って。", "zh": "骑在拥有纯白美丽翅膀的飞马背上……\n在广阔的天空中自由自在地翱翔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "282bc86937d011987449f84183d779130032c2758b1aa8977ae9b6d87b52cc39", "ja": "もう、現実世界に戻らなければいけないことは\n分かっていますけど。でも私は……！", "zh": "虽然我也明白，\n必须得回到现实世界了。可是我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5d7e3003f1eeb06efe013a83c18e743aee7c7e433075f3e0b9e469c834c89832", "ja": "ふむ…………。", "zh": "嗯…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_1006", "source_sha256": "97ea80d18189fee11687166bbec9d0917bf0657e6f06ae7f1d0abf681b93a085", "ja": "危ない！", "zh": "小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6ec83744065dd07f20b87cb4cae805a824d29c00500a66dcedde5bf7398cafd7", "ja": "百合子、後ろから巨大な影が！\nあれは……ワイバーンの群れだ！", "zh": "百合子，后面有个巨大的影子！\n那是……一群飞龙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "e981a5782340a78199b9b7f36e264561443f5741bb069af3faa53ce2b41f32cf", "ja": "えええぇぇっ！？　そ、そんないきなり言われても、\n戦う準備なんてできてませんよ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶！？就、就算你突然这么说，\n我也还没做好战斗准备啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2002_p", "source_sha256": "d3ab9ec673b66a8c0cdde925264f3c46ae58b3bc48c2a1d1824a3d820e43a0f7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nじゃあ一度、現実に戻ってこようか。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n那么，我们先回到现实吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2003_026yur", "source_sha256": "f833043da86e09e23a0391141553832b297d0f3db997c29975cc447fcdd12e53", "ja": "ハッ！　うう、今日くらいは撮影の余韻に\n思う存分浸ろうと思っていたのに……。", "zh": "哈！呜呜，我本来还想至少今天尽情沉浸在拍摄的余韵中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2004_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed727271bffa9f7d71d56745d9d79baf2f28ace4375758aa0ae55a0b7740b4a4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いじわるです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你太使坏了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2005_p", "source_sha256": "e03675fcf66c5129f0b7190ef3caf67cc1416f5540f5859b6da491c1093ab38e", "ja": "ごめんごめん。止めたくはなかったんだが、\n帰る準備があるからな。", "zh": "对不起对不起。我也不想叫停的，不过还得准备回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2006_026yur", "source_sha256": "dffb4c663e377eeaa3f8d139a859c5c6294aceaf6212db266d3e871d4adebe9b", "ja": "……わかりました。私には帰りを待ってる人がいます。\n今は涙を呑んで、あの世界にお別れを告げますっ！", "zh": "……我明白了。有人正在等我回去。\n现在就忍住泪水，向那个世界道别吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2007_026yur", "source_sha256": "66c55bd29f252dd34334013e34e072d6c3ecb8c578bb7806ea8e03a5f67a5979", "ja": "さようなら、優しきペガサス！　さようなら、\n自然豊かな世界！　その輝きは、またいつか……。", "zh": "再见了，温柔的飞马！再见了，自然风光优美的世界！那份光辉，今后总有一天还会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2008_026yur", "source_sha256": "04a59010c622ffc0b863b663529dc4729cf2783115949dea9d09ab4492896e4f", "ja": "さらば、風の戦士・リリー！　……というわけで、\n七尾百合子、ただいま戻りました！", "zh": "再见了，风之战士莉莉！……总之，\n七尾百合子，现在回来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2009_p", "source_sha256": "fafd83de473293583c7ae34ebbaaa80cda7a839d322f6f31ee7336e85b35b969", "ja": "おかえり。今の入れ込み具合をみると、\nPV撮影、相当楽しかったみたいだな。", "zh": "欢迎回来。看你现在这股投入劲儿，PV拍摄肯定特别开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2010_026yur", "source_sha256": "43e9717a522f9b11e29479f7e385d6253e207c9dd6b66740d49b5ca3c5c561e5", "ja": "はいっ！　撮影を通して『地球儀にない国』の世界を\nさらに理解できた気がします。", "zh": "是！通过这次拍摄，我感觉自己更加理解《地球仪上不存在的国家》的世界了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2011_026yur", "source_sha256": "20fa25d013e86995c7ee29edacad0655b414f2fa8978314b647b0d9e4a4db296", "ja": "いままでなにげなく歌っていた歌詞にも、\n意外な真実が……あれ？　でも、あの部分は……。", "zh": "就连之前毫不在意地唱过的歌词里，也隐藏着意想不到的真相……咦？可是，那一部分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2012_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb009664a044b9857a74a689da1ccad618d4b1c18b49bf2e6b0234c43a8e358d", "ja": "はっ！　すみません。すぐに着替えてきます！\n考察は劇場まで、我慢……我慢……！", "zh": "啊！抱歉，我马上去换衣服！\n先忍住……忍住，等到了剧场再继续思考……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0634_2013_p", "source_sha256": "875c72fb845c93a721fa5ec239af67e3f832dcccbee75398783b1a2a2f15a560", "ja": "（現実と空想を行き来して、風の戦士は成長していく。\nどこまでも続くこの冒険を、共に旅していこう）", "zh": "（风之战士在现实与幻想之间来回穿梭，不断成长。让我们一起踏上这场永无止境的冒险之旅吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
